":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/19-04","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Calculating N: One month’s salary per full year of service; half a month for periods under six months"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"If a company fires you without 30 days’ notice, it must pay an extra month’s salary"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"When a company unlawfully terminates employment, the compensation equals twice the standard severance amount"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Never sign “voluntary resignation for personal reasons”; doing so forfeits your entitlements"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Save pay stubs, attendance records, employment contracts, social insurance documents, and chat logs before leaving your job"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Before taking up a post where there is dust, noise, or chemicals, check whether the contract mentions any occupational hazards; the employer must arrange and pay for three occupational health examinations"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Damage caused by dust, noise, and chemical toxins is irreversible: employers must provide protective gear, and workers can refuse unsafe tasks"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"If you’re injured at work or hit while commuting, the first step is to get a work‑injury determination; if your employer won’t file it, you must do it yourself"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Don’t believe the myth that “staying at work counts as a workplace injury”: if you suddenly feel unwell, call 120 first — don’t rush to clock in"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Even if the employer fails to enroll you in workers’ compensation insurance, you still qualify for full benefits paid entirely by the employer at the same rates"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"After injuries stabilize, undergo a work capacity assessment; disability grades translate directly into compensation"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Three types of compensation for work-related deaths: funeral allowance, survivor’s pension, and one-time death benefit"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"If you’ve been bullied, insulted, or mistreated at work for a long time, don’t just endure it: document everything as evidence, then take action based on the nature of the abuse"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"When you leave a job, ask the employer for a termination certificate stating contract term, separation date, position, and years of service"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"Before spending severance pay, check individual income tax: amounts within three times the local prior-year average employee wage are tax-free; the excess is taxed separately, not merged into that year’s salary"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/19-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"When moving to another city for work, transfer your pension and medical insurance to the new place of enrollment; contribution years keep adding up, so do not withdraw from pension insurance"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","pro